    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57026" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφᾰλ-ωτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with a head, headed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				7a16
			</span></i>; of plants <i>with a head</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.149
				</span></i>
			, cf. Epaenet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.371e
			</span></i>, Mnesith. Cyz. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				15.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				12.1.8
			</span></i>: Subst. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτόν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσον</span>), τό, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1120.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>; also, of a bolt, <i>with a flat head</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περόνη κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Bel.</u>
					76.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
